    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "45 Broadford Crescent is a well-proportioned three-bedroom home ideally situated in the established residential area of Ballinteer, Dublin 16.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 95 sq. m., the property offers generous accommodation throughout, comprising three bedrooms and a main bathroom upstairs, and well-balanced living and kitchen areas on the ground floor. The property provides an excellent opportunity for buyers seeking a comfortable family home in a mature and highly convenient location.\r\n\r\nThe area is renowned for its family-friendly atmosphere and is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, parks and recreational facilities. The surrounding area is well served by public transport, and wider road networks provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre, Marlay Park, Dundrum Town Centre and the M50 all close by.\r\n\r\nWith its spacious accommodation, three bedrooms and excellent Dublin 16 location, 45 Broadford Crescent represents an attractive opportunity for first-time buyers, families and those looking to put their own stamp on a home.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
